        "bodyHtml": "Riven's weapon surges with spiritual energy, granting her <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(20% Attack Damage) Attack Damage</span> and increased range on damaging Abilities and Attacks for 15 seconds. While active, she can <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast.</span><br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast:</span> Riven fires a wind slash that deals between <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(100/150/200 + (55% bonus Attack Damage))</span> and <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(300/450/600 + (165% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>, based on their missing Health.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Gains 75 Attack Range</span>",
